Per-section breakdown of the new file (`tools/q4_sections.py`): bytes the alignment left
unmatched, matched bytes that differ, the share of those the oracle explains, and the number of
stream bytes the conditional coder charged to the section (exact, from the coder's per-byte
cost output).

